# Build order

When creating or extending the app, follow `BUILD.md` from top to bottom.

- Finish the current phase before starting the next one
- Install a library only in the phase that needs it (see the table at the bottom of `BUILD.md`)
- Stop after Phase 6 (MVP) unless the user asks for post-MVP work
- If the user names a single feature, still respect dependencies (e.g. no meals without Auth + profile tables)
- Do not invent extra steps, paid services, or libraries outside that list
